{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むぅ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『大人のカフェ』に続き、\nもうひとつ情報解禁されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台『じょしらく弐〜時かけそば〜』に出演致します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落語やります〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的には、3ヶ月連続舞台出演"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お稽古と本番がかぶさりまくりな上に、\n乃木坂のお仕事もあってわちゃわちゃだけど、\nこれだけ好きなお仕事やらせてもらえるって\nとっても幸せなことです。(_ _)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人の人間としても、もっと力をつけて頑張りたいな〜○゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日充実！はっぴーはっぴー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもまだ言えないけど、\n最近、色んなこと頑張ってました( *ˆ_ˆ* )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く解禁したいなぁ...うずうず！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらくはトリプルキャスト！\n｢チームく｣のメンバーは......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回一緒のチームで、すんごい成長を感じて大好きになった、ことこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年下だけど｢ちーちゃんお母さん｣って呼んで、いつも甘えさせてもらってる優しい、ちーちゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お芝居のこととか色々語り合ってた仲の、みりあ。\n一緒に舞台立てて嬉しい〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台経験者のれいかには、\n沢山頼ろ〜っと！(^○^)へへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみに私の役は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べらんめぇ口調で、\n女装男子疑惑のあるまりぃさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内股や女の子座りなどの仕草は苦手で、乙女な言動をするのが辛抱たまらない。\n「男とか女とか言う以前に子供」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...って説明見ただけでこれだ！！！って（笑）（笑）\n去年からず〜〜っとやりたかった役でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年越しに叶ったまりぃさん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ演じたい！楽しみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ、舞台の差し入れで、\nれなちさんがお茶をくれたんだけど、\nすんごくいい香りだし美味しくってハマっちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすが、渋いものが好きな私のことをわかってくれてるぅ〜〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家でも飲むし、毎日水筒に入れてお稽古にも持って行ってます ♪♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難う〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部飲み終わったら、自分でも買おーっと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとねー、友達のお母さんから\nこんなのももらったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヨーグルトとか牛乳に入れると美味しいんだって！すげぇ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな優しいなあ 泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう4月だったのね！\n気付かなかったあ〜(๑* * )ふぇぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨あがりってなんかわかんないけど\n好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花見行きたいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/04/7809532/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}